  "hash": 2934767476,
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Casting [Air Move] causes you to rapidly descend to the ground, instantly <stasis/>Shattering any <stasis/>Frozen targets or <stasis/>Stasis Crystals in a 8.5 meter radius.\n\nShatterdive deals a small amount of damage on impact, then deals an additional higher damage instance against <stasis/>Frozen enemies.\n\n<stasis/>Shattering a <stasis/>Stasis Crystal or <stasis/>Frozen Target with Shatterdive grants x5 Stacks of <stasis/>Frost Armor in PvE (x7 with <stasis/>Whisper of Rime), and x2 stacks in PvP.\n\nGrants Fall Damage Immunity and ?% Damage Resistance against <stasis/>Crystal Shatter Damage while diving.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T01:33:42.667Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
